<span class="_ _24"> </span><span class="ff1">差错检测</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y16d ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.2.1<span class="_ _32"> </span>CR<span class="_ _29"></span>C (Cy<span class="_ _4"></span>clic R<span class="_ _29"></span>edundancy Chec<span class="_ _29"></span>k, <span class="ff1">循环冗余校验</span>)</div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y16e ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.2.1.1<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">基本原理</span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 y16f ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">CR<span class="_ _29"></span>C <span class="ff4">是一种根据网<span class="_ _f"></span>络数据包或计算机文件等数据<span class="_ _f"></span>产生简短固定位数校验码的一<span class="_ _f"></span>种信道编码技术，主要用来</span></div><div class="t m0 x3 h7 y170 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">检测或校验数据传输或者保存后可能出现的错误。</div><div class="t m0 x26 h6 y171 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">核心运算<span class="ff4">：采用</span>模<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">2<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>运算<span class="ff4">（<span class="ff3">Modulo-2<span class="_ _0"> </span>Arithmetic</span>）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y172 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">实际上就是<span class="ff1">异或<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(X<span class="_ _29"></span>OR) <span class="ff4">运算。</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y173 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">规则：<span class="ffb">1<span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ffa">+<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>1<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _28"> </span></span>0<span class="ff8">,<span class="_ _8"> </span></span>1<span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ffa">+<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>0<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _28"> </span></span>1<span class="ff8">,<span class="_ _8"> </span></span>0<span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ffa">+<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>0<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _28"> </span></span>0<span class="ff8">,<span class="_ _e"> </span>